==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|zwo|zwō|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|twai|lang=gem-pro}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tsvoː/|lang=de}}

===Numeral===
{{head|de|numeral}}

# [[two]]

====Usage notes====
* {{term|zwei|Zwei|lang=de}} is the usual German word for "two", but {{term||zwo|lang=de}} is sometimes used as more clearly distinguishable from {{term|drei||three|lang=de}}, especially over the telephone. Used more in South Germany and Austria.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|de|zwei}}

